#: A3DA_Edit/Convert_Utils.py:98
msgid "!!! WARNING !!! This requires selected objects to be in Auth3D space (rotated 90°), or it will not work!"
msgstr "!!! 警告 !!! 这要求所选物体位于 Auth3D 空间（旋转 90°），否则将无法工作！"

#: A3DA_Utils/EmptiesToBones.py:44
msgid "(! Slow !) Creates a morph for the average scale of every object. Good enough for most of the cases."
msgstr "（! 慢 !）为每个物体的平均缩放创建形态键。大多数情况下够用。"

#: A3DA_Utils/EmptiesToBones.py:45
msgid "(!! Slower !!) Creates a scale morph for every axis of every object. Usefull for objects with non uniform scale."
msgstr "（!! 更慢 !!）为每个物体的每个轴创建缩放形态键。适用于非均匀缩放的物体。"

#: A3DA_UI.py:118
msgid "(EXPERIMENTAL) When enabled, all imported A3DA animations will loop. Usefull for old stages, breakes newer. Use with caution"
msgstr "（实验性）启用后，所有导入的 A3DA 动画都会循环。适用于旧场景，会破坏较新的场景。请谨慎使用"

#: A3DA_UI.py:153
msgid "(EXPERIMENTAL) When enabled, the importer will try to load the first a3da of a stage (STGPVxxxS01_EFF_001), even if its not declared in the pv_field. This is a workaround, idk if the game does this. Use with caution"
msgstr "（实验性）启用后，导入器会尝试加载场景的第一个 a3da（STGPVxxxS01_EFF_001），即使它未在 pv_field 中声明。这是一种变通方法，不确定游戏是否如此。请谨慎使用"

