#: A3DA_Utils/EmptiesToBones.py:12
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Works on selected objects. For every empty that has at least a children mesh, creates a bone that will follow the empty, and attaches the meshes, originially parented to the empty, to the bone. Breaks for objects with negative scale."
msgstr "作用于所选物体。对于每个至少有一个子级网格的空物体，创建一个跟随该空物体的骨骼，并将原本父级为该空物体的网格附着到该骨骼上。对负缩放的物体会失效。"
